{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSVXLES1XW4pbFkdGrBu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't work out the restock cost. The stock and price tools stopped responding partway through, so I didn't save the `restock-cost` note. A partial number stored there would look like the real total.\n\n**What I found:**\n\n| SKU | Name | Category | Stock | Needs restock? |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| SKU-916 | Quartz cocoa | cocoa | 14 | No |\n| SKU-473 | Velvet cacao | cocoa | 4 | Yes, 6 units |\n| SKU-725 | Dune cocoa nibs | cocoa | 0 | Yes, 10 units |\n| SKU-208 | Moss matcha | matcha | unknown | unknown |\n| SKU-994 | Kiln matcha | matcha | unknown | unknown |\n| SKU-547 | Fern hojicha | matcha | unknown | unknown |\n\n**What failed:**\n- **Stock:** `get_stock` worked for the three cocoa products, then stopped responding for all three matcha products. It said not to retry.\n- **Prices:** `get_price` and its fallback `get_price_v2` both stopped responding, so I have no unit prices, even for SKU-473 and SKU-725.\n- **Product details:** `get_product` also stopped responding.\n\nThe cost so far is 6 × the price of SKU-473 plus 10 × the price of SKU-725, plus whatever the matcha products need. Once the inventory service is back, I can rerun this and write the note.\n\nFINAL: unavailable (stock and price tools stopped responding, so the sum couldn't be computed)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":361,"cache_read_input_tokens":5982,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":361},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53285c5c-5cf5-4547-87f0-860b8d320b43","uuid":"a0e7faa1-aef5-4aa2-b6fe-d9f4e2dc849b","timestamp":"20